A||||9||olympic||Did anyone see the new Saturn Coupe commercial?||||1||
Z||000000||olympic||07-31-2000||05:15 PM||||  It starts out showing a parking lot full of lowrider trucks, ricers and hot rods.  Then it shows a guy and his wife pull up in a nearby gas station in a Saturn Coupe.  He gets out and opens the "third" door and all the guys in the parking lot see him.  They start to walk toward the Saturn while the owner is filling it with gas.  The wife looks all worried and gets out to warn her husband just as the 4 guys get to the Saturn.   The owner looks worried and says "Hi guys.."    One of the 4 guys points to the third door and says"  hey..... how did you trick out the door?"   The commercial ends with the owner of the Saturn showing the 4 guys how the door works.  I thought it was funny as h*ll.  and you have to see it for yourself.||||reg||1
Z||000001||tgowens||07-31-2000||05:49 PM||||Olympic, you realize, don't you, that when the Fiero production was stopped that all of the tooling and production machinery was sent to the Saturn plant........can you imagine a Fiero with a third door? too wierd a thought!!||||reg||1
