Z||000007||b lo 0||08-01-2000||11:13 AM||||I used to work for Saturn of Gwinnett, even drove an SC2 for awhile.  No, they're not that fast, but they are faster than a Duke-powered Fiero (esp. the 5-spds) and they handle WAY better than any Civic or MX5 ever could.  Now, granted some of the parts are kinda flimsy, namely the interior door handles (are you reading this, Saturn?)  but I really liked the overall build quality and VALUE!!  Plus the stock stereos with CD players sound really good.  I even drove an SL1 to Orlando Florida and back (800+ miles).  Very comfy, and lots of good features.<P>------------------<BR>'85 GT (in progress)  <BR>titled ICE-plates B LO 0 <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.angelfire.com/ga3/audioimagery/ice.gif">    <BR>Go to <A HREF="http://www.audioimagery.i-p.com" TARGET=_blank>www.audioimagery.i-p.com</A>  !!!||||reg||1
