Z||000009||Patrick||08-01-2000||02:23 PM||||<BR>I was in a Saturn dealership a few months ago to have a peek at this new 3-door Saturn. I asked the salesguy the purpose of the half-size third door (which is on the <I>driver's</I> side of the car). He explained it was perfect for letting kids in and out of the back seat. I gave him a puzzled look and asked why it was that the Saturn engineers would want the kiddies to have to come onto the road to enter and exit the car. No response from the salesguy! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
